      "authorSlug": null,
      "authorName": "Randall Balestriero",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T13:48:34.000Z",
      "text": "Forgot to mention, it is fully causal in time (pretraining and inference)! A more natural and efficient setup than bidirectional, especially for low latency on device applications! Hope you will try it on your data and share feeebacks! https://t.co/oU90sE7HuM",
