      "createdAt": "2026-08-28T12:58:08.000Z",
      "text": "SIGReg for pretraining Video Foundation Models! Our LeVJEPA opens many doors...\n- stable recipe with a simple loss (sigreg + prediction)\n- no tubelet, frame aggregation, EMA, stop-gradient, ....\n- 20X more FLOP efficient than VJEPA1/2 pretraining\n- open source + reproducible https://t.co/rCwJRx2Dim https://t.co/oU90sE7HuM",
      "url": "https://x.com/randall_balestr/status/2093322239529652671",
